I've found the error.....<br>The Runtime Library was set to "Multi-threaded Debug DLL".<br>Now it works with "Multi-threaded Debug (/Mtd)" ...<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1279">zorck</a> — Sat Dec 02, 2006 1:59 pm</p><hr />
