		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Problems with Integrating Bullet Collision Detection Library]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=2582#p2582"><![CDATA[
Make sure that all the libraries/projects in you solution are using the same run-time library. See you Project settings/C++/Codegeneration runtime library.<br><br>This info should go in the Bullet_User_Manual.pdf.<br>Hope this helps,<br>Erwin<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2">Erwin Coumans</a> — Sun Nov 26, 2006 4:12 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
